  (text "GPIO map: OLED SPI (FSPI) SCK 12, MOSI 11, CS 10, DC 9, RST 8. CAN TX 5, RX 6. Select knob (J4) contacts 2 / 3 on ADC1 1 / 2, Volume knob (J5) contacts 2 / 3 on ADC1 4 / 7. IR in 39. USB 19 / 20. Strapping pins 0, 3, 45, 46 not used except BOOT (0)." (at 120 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f0ba7cb-9fc1-591e-9836-30e829e4768c"))
